<title>POLAND: Jutrzenka to list one mln shrs Aug 18.</title>
<headline>Jutrzenka to list one mln shrs Aug 18.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw Stock Exchange on August 18 will add one million shares of Polish confectioner Jutrzenka SA to the 806,761 already in bourse trade, the bourse said in a statement on Wednesday. The shares are from an April issue.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
